- Hello.

00:00:02.595 --> 00:00:04.410
(audience cheering)

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:05.273
- Hi.

00:00:05.273 --> 00:00:07.920
- [Kelly] Once again, y'all
are all in a music video

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.440
