00:00:15.524 --> 00:00:17.700
- I know but then you've got
the gold and the black in it.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.110
It's very nice, it all ties in.

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:21.900
As I mentioned, you were the first woman

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.490
to win a WrestleMania
main event. (cheering)

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.490
So can you explain- (cheering)

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:27.700
very excited.

00:00:28.908 --> 00:00:30.540
Can you explain for people
that don't know what that is,

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:31.373
what is that?

00:00:31.373 --> 00:00:33.150
- So, well WrestleMania, it's

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:35.913
like our version of the
Super Bowl, essentially.

00:00:37.132 --> 00:00:42.028
And so for 35 years there
had never been a woman

00:00:42.028 --> 00:00:46.273
or any women to have main
evented our Super Bowl.

00:00:46.273 --> 00:00:47.978
And so...

00:00:47.978 --> 00:00:51.172
(clapping, cheering)

00:00:51.172 --> 00:00:52.950
- And they wanted it.

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:54.369
- And the people wanted it.

00:00:54.369 --> 00:00:55.202
And that was the thing.

00:00:55.202 --> 00:00:58.571
You know, it's the goal of any wrestler,

00:00:58.571 --> 00:00:59.404
anybody who gets into the business,

00:00:59.404 --> 00:01:01.050
they want a main event at WrestleMania.

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:01.883
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:01.883 --> 00:01:03.900
- And I remember when I first,
not when I first started

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:06.240
but when I first got
signed to WWE I told one

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:08.550
of my friends, and a very
supportive friend by the way-

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:09.623
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:09.623 --> 00:01:11.339
