event WrestleMania.

00:01:11.339 --> 00:01:13.680
And he said, "it's nice to
have dreams, but be realistic."

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:15.060
And, yeah.

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:17.940
Which seems like, oh, gut punch.

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:19.590
But it was just, it was just seen

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:23.160
as such a far away goal that
it just wouldn't be possible.

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:24.715
But we made it possible!

00:01:24.715 --> 00:01:26.880
(cheering)

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:28.563
And the fans made it possible.

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:32.730
- So tell us about the
upcoming... it's WW Rumble.

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:33.563
It's the Royal Rumble?

00:01:33.563 --> 00:01:34.924
- It's the Royal Rumble.

00:01:34.924 --> 00:01:35.757
- Royal Rumble.

00:01:35.757 --> 00:01:37.980
I can't say Royal, Royal Rumble.

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:39.960
I can't, look, we found a word.

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:41.730
Hope it's not in a song I have to sing,

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:43.320
Royal Rumble.

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:44.250
I can't say "royal."

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:46.093
So what is this for everybody?

00:01:46.093 --> 00:01:47.128
What can we expect?

00:01:47.128 --> 00:01:49.350
- So Royal Rumble, it's the
lead up to WrestleMania.

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:51.173
Oh, by the way, WrestleMania
is in Los Angeles this year.

00:01:52.062 --> 00:01:53.328
(audience cheers)

00:01:53.328 --> 00:01:54.690
- It is, it is in Los Angeles
this year, you're right.

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:57.570
- So, if you happen to be
free, if anybody happens

00:01:57.570 --> 00:01:59.340
to be free, April 1st and 2nd.

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:01.410
- Only if I get to body slam someone.

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:03.300
I'm just kidding. (Kelly laughs)

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:04.441
That sounds fun.

00:02:04.441 --> 00:02:07.110
- We can always have beef Kelly.

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:08.250
We'll make up some beef.

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:09.390
Anyway-

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:10.263
- I like this.

00:02:11.255 --> 00:02:14.940
- So, the Royal Rumble is
the lead up to WrestleMania.

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:16.680
And so what the Royal Rumble is,

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.230
it's a 30 person battle royal.

00:02:19.230 --> 00:02:22.521
But two people start
off and every 90 seconds

00:02:22.521 --> 00:02:26.280
a new person comes in
until we get to 30 people.

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:28.032
And the person who wins that throws every-

00:02:28.032 --> 00:02:31.590
And to win you have to throw
everybody out the top rope

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:33.780
or you have to outlast everybody.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:34.613
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:34.613 --> 00:02:35.446
- You have to be the last person standing

00:02:35.446 --> 00:02:36.943
and everybody has to go-

00:02:36.943 --> 00:02:37.776
- [Kelly] 30 people.

00:02:37.776 --> 00:02:38.609
- over the top rope.

00:02:38.609 --> 00:02:40.290
And then you get to stand there and point

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:41.310
to the WrestleMania sign.

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:42.810
Because there's a big WrestleMania sign.

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:45.480
Everybody always wants to
point to the WrestleMania sign.

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:47.190
And so and so that is the goal.

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:49.260
But it's, it's the most

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:53.430
it's always been my
favorite premium live event

00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:54.420
that we've done.

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:56.100
And so when I was a little kid

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:58.290
I'd stay up till four
o'clock in the morning

00:02:58.290 --> 00:02:59.550
back in Ireland watching it.

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:00.383
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:03:01.348 --> 00:03:02.850
- And to be able to do it now and to have

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:04.590
actually been a Royal Rumble winner-

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:05.423
- [Kelly] That's so cool.

00:03:05.423 --> 00:03:06.750
