00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:22.440
And you were like, "I'm
lying to get into wrestling."

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:23.280
I love it.

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:26.319
- Well, like I was a little,
I was a little bit of a dosser

00:03:26.319 --> 00:03:28.050
and a little bit of a
waster and I was like...

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:29.719
I was 15, I was like, I need to-

00:03:29.719 --> 00:03:31.080
- What is a dosser and
a waster? (Seal laughs)

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:32.887
- I knew you were going
to ask that question.

00:03:32.887 --> 00:03:33.810
(all laugh)

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:36.210
- What does that mean?
You just spoke in code.

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:38.873
- Well you know, I'd
just be up to no good.

00:03:38.873 --> 00:03:39.706
- [Kelly] Oh.

00:03:39.706 --> 00:03:40.539
- I was up to no good, Kelly.

00:03:40.539 --> 00:03:41.372
- Oh, okay.

00:03:41.372 --> 00:03:42.205
- And-

00:03:42.205 --> 00:03:43.038
- That could be fun

00:03:43.038 --> 00:03:43.871
- And I needed to not be up to no good.

00:03:43.871 --> 00:03:45.013
- [Kelly] Okay, okay.

00:03:45.013 --> 00:03:46.264
- You know? I needed to get
in the straight and narrow.

00:03:46.264 --> 00:03:47.272
- [Kelly] You needed some focus.

00:03:47.272 --> 00:03:48.105
- Yes.

00:03:48.105 --> 00:03:48.977
- [Kelly] Okay. Okay.

00:03:48.977 --> 00:03:50.185
- And I thought professional wrestling

00:03:50.185 --> 00:03:51.253
will get me on the straight and narrow.

00:03:51.253 --> 00:03:54.282
(all laugh)

00:03:54.282 --> 00:03:55.950
- Oh my God.

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:57.870
- And so I found out they were opening

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:00.360
this wrestling school,
down about an hour away

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.200
from where I live.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.273
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:04:02.273 --> 00:04:03.851
- And so my brother found
out and he was gonna go down

00:04:03.851 --> 00:04:05.070
and I was like, "I wanna go down."

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:06.390
He's like, "you can't go down,

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.370
I don't wanna be looking
after me little sister."

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:10.170
And I was like, "you won't
be looking after me."

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:11.445
I was lying already.

00:04:11.445 --> 00:04:12.373
(laughing)

00:04:12.373 --> 00:04:15.330
And he said, well, you have to be 16.

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:16.500
