00:04:41.003 --> 00:04:42.270
- [Kelly] Exactly, exactly.

00:04:42.270 --> 00:04:43.860
- And it worked. I'm a genius.

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:44.693
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:04:44.693 --> 00:04:46.091
- And here I am.

00:04:46.091 --> 00:04:47.755
(laughing)

00:04:47.755 --> 00:04:50.820
- I love you so much, one
of my favorite guests.

00:04:50.820 --> 00:04:52.054
Oh my god.

00:04:52.054 --> 00:04:53.520
